    {
      "index": 1,
      "sectionIndex": 0,
      "section": "The First Pill",
      "text": "The FDA just approved Merck's once-daily pill, the first oral version of a class defined by injectable monoclonal antibodies.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"first oral version\"",
        "phrase": "first oral version"
      },
      "startMs": 6640,
      "endMs": 16380
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "sectionIndex": 1,
      "section": "The Adherence Wall",
      "text": "The problem those injectables never solved was adherence, needles, biweekly dosing, specialty pharmacy friction.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"adherence\"",
        "phrase": "adherence"
      },
      "startMs": 16380,
      "endMs": 24800
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "sectionIndex": 1,
      "section": "The Adherence Wall",
      "text": "A daily pill routes through standard retail pharmacy.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"standard retail pharmacy\"",
        "phrase": "standard retail pharmacy"
      },
      "startMs": 24800,
      "endMs": 28780
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "sectionIndex": 2,
      "section": "The Race Shifts",
      "text": "AstraZeneca was in the same race. Now they trail.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"Now they trail\"",
        "phrase": "Now they trail"
      },
      "startMs": 28780,
      "endMs": 32800
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "sectionIndex": 3,
      "section": "The Real Signal",
      "text": "The real signal is bigger than cholesterol.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"bigger than cholesterol\"",
        "phrase": "bigger than cholesterol"
      },
      "startMs": 32800,
      "endMs": 35920
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "sectionIndex": 3,
      "section": "The Real Signal",
      "text": "If a monoclonal antibody mechanism can be reformulated into an FDA-approved pill, every injectable biologic in chronic care becomes an oral disruption target.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"oral disruption target\"",
        "phrase": "oral disruption target"
      },
      "startMs": 35920,
      "endMs": 48320
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "sectionIndex": 4,
      "section": "In This Week's Brief",
      "text": "The full read on what this means for GLP-1s, IL-17, and Merck's cardio franchise is in this week's BioIntel brief.",
